ferx: copyrights and licenses
=============================

The ferx R package is built from two kinds of code with different licenses.
Installed, this file is system.file("COPYRIGHTS", package = "ferx"); the files
it names sit beside it.


1. The package's own code: MIT
------------------------------

The R code (R/), the Rust glue (src/rust/src/), the build scripts, the
documentation and the bundled examples of the ferx R package are

